Fresh native acceptance uses frozen production-equivalent source `75c8f4c`:34CPU/42no-nvCOMP/45nvCOMP named tests, real512MiB Adler oracle, null-output gate-removal and predecessor-arithmetic mutants, plus actual caller diagnostic-order controls. SCARF3521765 is **QUEUED/QOSGrpNodeLimit, UNRUN**. Existing limits/jobs are unchanged. Readback injection on healthy decoded input is not malformed-decoder safety evidence; #134 trust/dependency promotion hold remains.

@codex review Please review only the modular checksum/output-acceptance repair, actual-kernel/caller controls and preserved current-main composition. Wider-route promotion is not requested.

Native VM replay at frozen75c8 source: CPU34/34 and CUDA-without-nvCOMP42/42 PASS; nvCOMP44/45, **CudaNvcompAcceptanceFailures FAIL**. Actual decoder rejected strip1 with original status/length diagnostic in the per-movie log, while process streams had pinned-ingest refusal and all three readback witnesses. The test incorrectly searched only process output. Raw failure preserved; no production arithmetic/policy changed.

